{"unit_id":"tag:020M:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节说明一个构造我们将使用的景（sites）的一般过程。假设我们想研究概形（schemes）上相对于某个拓扑（topology）<MATH_0001>的层（sheaves）。为了得到一个景（site），如《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中所述，由具有该拓扑（topology）的概形（schemes）组成，我们必须做一些工作。具体而言，不能简单地说“考虑具有 Zariski 拓扑（topology）的所有概形（schemes）”，因为这样会得到一个“大”范畴（category）。我们将在本章每节中按如下步骤进行：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们定义概形（schemes）的覆盖（coverings）的一个类（class）<MATH_0002>，它满足《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0002>的公理。一个概形（scheme）的 Zariski 开覆盖（Zariski open covering）总是<MATH_0003>的覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 在仿射概形（affine schemes）的范畴（category）中，我们选定标准<MATH_0004>覆盖（covering）的概念。\n<STRUCT_0005> 我们定义什么是“绝对”的大<MATH_0005>景（site）<MATH_0006>。这些景（sites）通过适当选择一个概形（schemes）的集合（set）和一个覆盖（coverings）的集合（set）得到。\n<STRUCT_0006> 对任意对象（object）<MATH_0007>，它属于<MATH_0008>，我们定义大<MATH_0009>景（site）<MATH_0010>，并对适当的<MATH_0011>定义小（small）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这里的“大”和“小（small）”两个词与相应范畴（categories）的大小无关。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001><MATH_0012>景（site）<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0007> 此外，还有一个景（site）<MATH_0014>，它使用仿射概形（affines）的标准<MATH_0015>覆盖（covering）的概念<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0002>在 ph 拓扑（topology）的情形中，我们与这种做法略有不同，见定义<REF_0003>及其前后的讨论。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0002>；其层（sheaves）范畴（category）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0016>上的层（sheaves）范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n上述做法略显笨拙，因为我们最终不能为一个概形（scheme）的大<MATH_0017>景（site），甚至为一个概形（scheme）的小（small）<MATH_0018>景（site），作出典范（canonical）选择。如果愿意忽略集合（set）论方面的困难，就可以使用类（classes），从而得到典范（canonical）的大景和小（small）景（sites）……\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski","ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Zariski open covering","target_term":"Zariski 开覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"构造的景，未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"本节对象，未批准"}