{"unit_id":"tag:020O:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0002><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是概形（schemes）的一个态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0003>，使得每个<MATH_0004>都是开浸入（open immersion），并且<MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"定义对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"定义术语，未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"覆盖族，未批准"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"覆盖条件，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020N:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这定义了覆盖（coverings）的一个（真（proper））类（class）。接下来，我们证明这个概念满足《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>的条件。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"真"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖的类，未批准"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"真","context":"真类限定词，未批准"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"集合论类，未批准"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"引用章名，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020P:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>都有一个 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且<MATH_0010>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"引理对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"首条公理，未批准"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"覆盖公理，未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"基变换对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基变换，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020P:proof","translation":"略。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[],"unknown_terms":[],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020Q:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。则存在一个 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0004>，它是<MATH_0005>的加细（refinement），使得每个<MATH_0006>都是<MATH_0007>的标准开集（standard open），见《概形（Schemes）》定义<REF_0001>。此外，可以选择每个<MATH_0008>为某个<MATH_0009>的开集（open）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"standard open","target_term":"标准开集"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"引理对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"覆盖类型，未批准"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"覆盖关系，未批准"},{"source_term":"standard open","target_term":"标准开集","context":"加细成员，未批准"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集","context":"覆盖成员开集，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020Q:proof","translation":"这由<MATH_0001>拟紧（quasi-compact）且标准开集（standard opens）构成其拓扑（topology）的基（basis）得出。《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>中也证明了这一点。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"standard opens","target_term":"标准开集"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"仿射概形性质，未批准"},{"source_term":"standard opens","target_term":"标准开集","context":"拓扑基，未批准"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"概形拓扑，未批准"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基","context":"开集基，未批准"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020N:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，我们如下定义仿射概形（affines）的相应标准覆盖（coverings）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"标准覆盖对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"标准覆盖，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020R:statement","translation":"比较《概形（Schemes）》定义<REF_0001>。设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准 Zariski 覆盖（standard Zariski covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对于<MATH_0002>，是一个 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0003>，其中每个<MATH_0004>都诱导一个同构（isomorphism），其目标是<MATH_0005>的某个标准仿射开集（affine open）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"standard Zariski covering","target_term":"标准 Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"定义对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"standard Zariski covering","target_term":"标准 Zariski 覆盖","context":"定义术语，未批准"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"覆盖类型，未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"覆盖条件，未批准"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"标准开集，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020S:statement","translation":"<TEXTITOPEN_0001>大 Zariski 景（big Zariski site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是任意景（site）<MATH_0001>，如《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中所述，按如下方式构造：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 选择任意概形（schemes）集合（set）<MATH_0002>，以及这些概形（schemes）之间的任意 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski coverings）集合（set）<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 作为<MATH_0004>的底层范畴（underlying category），取任意范畴（category）<MATH_0005>，它如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>中那样从集合（set）<MATH_0006>出发构造。\n<STRUCT_0004> 作为<MATH_0007>的覆盖（coverings），选择如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>中的任意覆盖（coverings）集合（set），从范畴（category）<MATH_0008>、Zariski 覆盖（Zariski coverings）的类（class）以及上面选定的集合（set）<MATH_0009>出发。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big Zariski site","target_term":"大 Zariski 景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Zariski coverings","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Zariski coverings","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"big Zariski site","target_term":"大 Zariski 景","context":"定义术语，未批准"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"构造对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"选定对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"构造集合，未批准"},{"source_term":"Zariski coverings","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"选定覆盖，未批准"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"景的底层范畴，未批准"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"构造的范畴，未批准"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"景的覆盖，未批准"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"覆盖的类，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:020N:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0001>表明，选定范畴（category）<MATH_0001>之后，<MATH_0002>上的层（sheaves）范畴（category）不依赖于上面 (3) 中所选覆盖（coverings）的选择。换言之，拓扑斯（topos）<MATH_0003>只依赖于范畴（category）<MATH_0004>的选择。《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>表明，这些范畴（categories）对代数几何（algebraic geometry）的许多构造封闭，例如纤维积（fibre products）以及取开子概形（open subschemes）和闭子概形（closed subschemes）。我们还可以证明，<MATH_0005>的确切选择并不太重要，见第<REF_0003>节。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一种做法是假设存在一个强不可达基数（strongly inaccessible cardinal），并将<MATH_0006>定义为包含在一个选定宇宙（universe）中的概形（schemes）的范畴（category），以包含在同一宇宙（universe）中的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski coverings）作为覆盖（coverings）集合（set）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n在继续引入概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>的大 Zariski 景（big Zariski site）之前，我们指出，大 Zariski 景（big Zariski site）<MATH_0008>上的拓扑（topology）在某种意义上由所有概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上的 Zariski 拓扑（topology）诱导。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"open subschemes","target_term":"开子概形"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"strongly inaccessible cardinal","target_term":"强不可达基数"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"宇宙"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"universe","target_term":"宇宙"},{"source_term":"Zariski coverings","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_