{"unit_id":"tag:03WV:proof","translation":"由于每个<MATH_0001>都是开浸入（open immersion），由《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0001>可知，每个<MATH_0002>都同构（isomorphic）于对象（object）<MATH_0003>，它属于<MATH_0004>。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>与<MATH_0006>重言等价（tautologically equivalent）（两个方向都使用<MATH_0007>上的恒等映射（identity map））。此外，<MATH_0008>组合等价（combinatorially equivalent）于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，它是<MATH_0010>在景（site）<MATH_0011>中的覆盖，这由《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"tautologically equivalent","target_term":"重言等价"},{"source_term":"identity map","target_term":"恒等映射"},{"source_term":"combinatorially equivalent","target_term":"组合等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"覆盖成员，未批准"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合","context":"引用章名，未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"对象替换，未批准"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"景的对象，未批准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"替换覆盖，未批准"},{"source_term":"tautologically equivalent","target_term":"重言等价","context":"覆盖关系，未批准"},{"source_term":"identity map","target_term":"恒等映射","context":"等价所用映射，未批准"},{"source_term":"combinatorially equivalent","target_term":"组合等价","context":"所选覆盖关系，未批准"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"覆盖所在景，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
