{"unit_id":"tag:020N:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n小 Zariski 景（small Zariski site）、大仿射 Zariski 景（big affine Zariski site）和小仿射 Zariski 景（small affine Zariski site）确实是景（sites），这一点尚不完全清楚。现在验证。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小 Zariski 景"},{"source_term":"big affine Zariski site","target_term":"大仿射 Zariski 景"},{"source_term":"small affine Zariski site","target_term":"小仿射 Zariski 景"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小 Zariski 景","context":"待验证结构，未批准"},{"source_term":"big affine Zariski site","target_term":"大仿射 Zariski 景","context":"待验证结构，未批准"},{"source_term":"small affine Zariski site","target_term":"小仿射 Zariski 景","context":"待验证结构，未批准"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"公理要求，未批准"}],"notes":[]}
